                                "sense_id": "88a0423b-a106-3bcb-a83f-a7fc93e684ac",
                                "text": "'There,' she went on, 'it [a scarab] must be one like it, and yet never did I see one like it, for thereto hung a history, and he who wore it prized it much.[']"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
